{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: When you purchase this DLC, the Mega Drive version of \u201cGaiares\u201d (both Japanese and English) will be added to the launcher and become playable. The Telenet Shooting Collection Launcher is required to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gaiares (Mega Drive version release date: December 26, 1990)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven toward environmental ruin by human actions, Mother Earth now faces humanity\u2019s greatest and final choice. Can Earth be saved?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the young pilot and battle the Gulfer forces as they close in on Earth. Master the Option\u2019s unique properties to power up your ship and shape your combat strategy, the key to conquering this distinctive shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trademarks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEGA, the SEGA logo, and Mega Drive are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA Corporation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907160?t=1760486719","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907160?t=1760486719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907160/88b30f631057e7aaa7985166bc421650d1b768c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760486719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907160/88b30f631057e7aaa7985166bc421650d1b768c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760486719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: When you purchase this DLC, the Mega Drive version of \u201cGaiares\u201d (both Japanese and English) will be added to the launcher and become playable. The Telenet Shooting Collection Launcher is required to play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gaiares (Mega Drive version release date: December 26, 1990)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven toward environmental ruin by human actions, Mother Earth now faces humanity\u2019s greatest and final choice. Can Earth be saved?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the young pilot and battle the Gulfer forces as they close in on Earth. Master the Option\u2019s unique properties to power up your ship and shape your combat strategy, the key to conquering this distinctive shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trademarks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEGA, the SEGA logo, and Mega Drive are registered trademarks or trademarks of SEGA Corporation.</p>","developers":["Edia Co., Ltd."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3888230","name":"Telenet Shooting Collection Launcher"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907160/0971b911e3c12bb6f8db125cba52785d3e31e1d9/header.jpg?t=1760486719","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Edia Co., Ltd.<br />\r\nEmulation Used Under GPL License - Mednafen","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"GAIARES","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> \uff16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 730, 2 GB or AMD Radeon HD 7570, 1GB or Intel HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Edia Co., Ltd."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","desc